ECHO OFF
%2
CD \BOARDCHK
CLS
ECHO HD6303 ONLY - GAME AND SOUND CHECK
ECHO HDCHECK programs-dir work-drive
ECHO Use the same BOARDCHK directory.
ECHO JHD01 READY - automatic SDK test
PAUSE
%1\SDKTEST
ECHO Expected: PASS: SDK tiles/scrolling
PAUSE
ECHO JHD02 READY - GFX
ECHO SPACE switches pages; ESC exits.
PAUSE
%1\GFX
%2
CD \BOARDCHK
CLS
ECHO JHD03 READY - ARKANOID
ECHO Check keys, mouse and sound.
ECHO ESC ends game; close score list.
PAUSE
%1\ARKANOID
%2
CD \BOARDCHK
CLS
ECHO JHD04 READY - XONIX
ECHO Check keys, sound and timer.
ECHO ESC ends game; close score list.
PAUSE
%1\XONIX
%2
CD \BOARDCHK
CLS
ECHO JHD05 READY - HAM8 image
ECHO Inspect colours; ESC exits.
PAUSE
%1\HVIEW %1\LENA.IFF
%2
CD \BOARDCHK
CLS
ECHO JHD06 READY - AY music
ECHO SPACE pauses; ESC stops music.
PAUSE
%1\YPLAY %1\DEMO.YM /L
%2
CD \BOARDCHK
CLS
ECHO JHD CHECK END
ECHO DIR must work after every exit.
ECHO Check video, mouse and sound.
ECHO ON
